---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section>
  <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto text-center text-white">
    <h2 class="gradient-section-title">
      Our Vision
    </h2>
    <div class="w-[100px] h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold to-transparent mx-auto mb-8"></div>
    
    <p class="text-xl text-gold leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Omniversify is a movement derived from the theory of infinite coexisting realities. 
      We exist to ensure our stories are seen, heard, and felt. We're building an extended 
      version of Moroccan history to fill the gaps and create a full, comprehensive timeline 
      without question marks. Through immersive games, we celebrate Morocco's multicultural legacy, 
      amplify the Global South's silenced histories, and unite communities through shared creativity.
    </p>
    
    <p class="text-xl text-gold leading-relaxed mb-6">
      For too long, Western narratives have reduced ours to footnotes or caricatures. 
      We flip the script by promoting Amazigh Heritage and dismantling divisive myths, 
      bridging cultures across the Maghreb through North African Unity, and illuminating 
      stories textbooks ignore with Global South Solidarity. Our games are acts of 
      resistance — blending history, fantasy, and cultural truth.
    </p>
    
    <blockquote class="text-xl text-gold italic border-none p-6 bg-gold/10 rounded-lg leading-relaxed mt-8">
      "I'd be sure every time folks knew this version wasn't mine<br class="my-2" />
      which is why it is called 'His story'"<br />
      <cite class="block mt-4 text-base not-italic opacity-80">— Gil Scott-Heron</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</Section>
